From 21f7ea63fa9efaae9c71b95227d547cffa61fb14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sgrolik-base <s.grolik@baselinker.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:16:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat(calls): contact picker on dialer avatar, contact
 search in number box

- Dialer number box is now an AutoSuggestBox: digits are cleaned and
  dialed as before, names (or partial numbers in any format) suggest
  matching contacts; picking one fills the dialer
- Clicking the dialer avatar opens a searchable list of all contacts
- Contact search matches numbers regardless of spaces/brackets

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
